  speakerName: Lola Bebang
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 431c291e6a9edde459aa387cb0de89cb, type: 3}
  dialogueText: 'No kayatmo a maammoan no asino ti pagsasaritaanmo, agusarka iti
    ''asino.''


    Kayatna a saoen ti ''who.''


    Denggem a naimbag: asino.


    Ita,
    padasem nga ibagam ti ''asino'' iti bukodmo a timek.'
  translatedText: 'When you want to know which person you are talking about, use
    ''asino.''

    It means ''who.''

    Now, try saying ''asino'' yourself.'
